          "iast": "rāmaḥ nāma",
          "devanagari": "रामः नाम",
          "meaning": "Rama, known as",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 9
        },
        {
          "itrans": "mahaatejaa putraH bhaviSyati",
          "iast": "mahātejā putraḥ bhaviṣyati",
          "devanagari": "महातेजा पुत्रः भविष्यति",
          "meaning": "great-resplendent, son, will be there.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.62.5",
      "label": "4.62.5",
      "numbers": [
        5
      ],
      "devanagari": "अरण्यम् च सह भ्रात्रा लक्ष्मणेन गमिष्यति |\nतस्मिन् अर्थे नियुक्तः सन् पित्रा सत्य पराक्रमः",
      "iast": "araṇyam ca saha bhrātrā lakṣmaṇena gamiṣyati |\ntasmin arthe niyuktaḥ san pitrā satya parākramaḥ",
      "translation": "\" 'When his father assigns him for that objective of his going to forests, that truth-valiant Rama goes to forests along with his brother Lakshmana...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "satya para aakramaH",
          "iast": "satya para ākramaḥ",
          "devanagari": "सत्य पर आक्रमः",
