          "meaning": "to forest, he goes.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.62.6",
      "label": "4.62.6",
      "numbers": [
        6
      ],
      "devanagari": "नैर्ऋतो रावणो नाम तस्य भार्याम् हरिष्यति |\nराक्षसेन्द्रो जनस्थानात् अवध्यः सुर दानवैः",
      "iast": "nair.hṛto rāvaṇo nāma tasya bhāryām hariṣyati |\nrākṣasendro janasthānāt avadhyaḥ sura dānavaiḥ",
      "translation": "\" 'A demon named Ravana, the chief of demons, and an unkillable one even for gods or demons abducts Rama's wife from Janasthaana...",
