      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.62.7",
      "label": "4.62.7",
      "numbers": [
        7
      ],
      "devanagari": "सा च कामैः प्रलोभ्यन्ती भक्ष्यैः भोज्यैः च मैथिली |\nन भोक्ष्यति महाभागा दुःख मग्ना यशस्विनी",
      "iast": "sā ca kāmaiḥ pralobhyantī bhakṣyaiḥ bhojyaiḥ ca maithilī |\nna bhokṣyati mahābhāgā duḥkha magnā yaśasvinī",
      "translation": "\" 'She that Maithili, a highly privileged and prestigious lady does not touch any food, though she is highly lured by banquets and feasts by that Ravana, for she will be sunken in sorrow...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
