      "devanagari": "एष्यन्ति प्रेषिताः तत्र राम दूताः प्लवंगमाः |\nआख्येया राम महिषी त्वया तेभ्यो विहंगम",
      "iast": "eṣyanti preṣitāḥ tatra rāma dūtāḥ plavaṃgamāḥ |\nākhyeyā rāma mahiṣī tvayā tebhyo vihaṃgama",
      "translation": "\" 'Ushered by Rama, oh, sky-flyer Sampaati, fly-jumpers will be going over to the place where Seetha is captivated as harbingers of Rama, and you ought to tell those monkeys about the queen of Rama...",
