          "iast": "draṣṭum icchāmi",
          "devanagari": "द्रष्टुं इच्छामि",
          "meaning": "to see, I wish to",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "ciram praaNaan dhaarayitum",
          "iast": "ciram prāṇān dhārayitum",
          "devanagari": "चिरं प्राणान् धारयितुं",
          "meaning": "prolongedly, lives, to bear",
